Critique AI proposals: PatientManager, PractitionerManager, AppointmentManager, ClinicController, NotificationManager, ScheduleEngine.

PatientManager: Good Selection  
PractitionerManager: Good Selection  
AppointmentManager: Good Selection  
ClinicController: Good selection, there should be a centralized control system for the clinic to use.  
NotificationManager: Bad Selection, none of the requirements state there should be notifications for appointments.  
ScheduleEngine: Good/Bad Selection, having an Engine to perform the tasks could make the system more efficient, however, it might be out of the scope.
